+        // The shift is RELATIVE to the data scale, eps = max(eps, 1e-12*max(diag)),
+        // the caller's eps kept as an absolute floor.  When the equality
+        // constraints are linearly dependent, as in SOS programs with redundant
+        // equalities (rank(A)/m = 0.64-0.93 measured), A*A' is singular and must
