+        // magnitude below the roundoff of the factorization, which scales like
+        // machine_eps * ||AAt|| * m: 2.3e-11 to 2.1e-10 at max(diag) ~ 30-40 and
+        // m ~ 3.4e3-8.1e4.  Measured on such programs: chol(AAt + 1e-16*I) fails
+        // on every one, chol(AAt + 1e-12*max(diag)*I) succeeds on every one.
